==English==

===Etymology===
[[Image:Self-lacing kid gloves.gif|thumb|right]]
From [[kid]] gloves (made from the skin of a young [[lamb]] or [[goat]]), a particularly fine, soft material. [http://www.straightdope.com/mailbag/mkidglove.html 1]

===Verb===
{{infl|en|verb|head=[[handle]] [[with]] [[kid]] [[gloves]]}}

# {{idiomatic}} (''US'') To treat something very [[delicately]] or [[carefully]].
#: ''The campaign staff cautioned the candidate to '''handle''' the issue '''with kid gloves'''.''

